Package: rENM.analysis
Type: Package
Title: Analysis tools for the rENM framework
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "John L.", family = "Schnase",
    email = "rENM.Framework@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7473-3977"))
Description: Provides post-modeling analysis tools for the rENM
    framework, including Theil-Sen suitability trend computation, weighted
    centroid tracking, bioclimatic velocity estimation, hotspot detection,
    range change quantification, and variable contribution summaries
    across the rENM time series.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
